EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}You aren't skipping your training
'cause of a little rain, are you?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}No te irás a quedar sin entrenar
por un poquito de lluvia, ¿no,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Non vorrai saltare gli allenamenti
per qualche goccia di pioggia, vero?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Biraz yağmur yüzünden antrenmanı
aksatmıyorsun, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

DE:
Es regnet, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Stell dich lieber bei jemandem
zu Hause unter, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}That sun thing is asleep on the job. {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
I wish it would hurry up and fix this
rain, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Ce fichu soleil s'est fait la malle.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Et nous, alors ? Quel égoïste,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Sembra che il sole sia in ferie. {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Vorrei che tornasse e cacciasse via
questa pioggia, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Şu güneş denen şey görev başında uyuyor. {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Bir an önce uyanıp şu yağmuru düzeltse
keşke, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Was willst du denn mit dem Schirm?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Du musst den Regen mit deinem
ganzen Körper aufsaugen.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ein klasse Gefühl, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Böyle bir günde şemsiye kullanmamak...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
İşte sen olayı çözmüşsün!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Şemsiye sadece yük!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yağmurun seni dövmesine izin vermek
en güzeli, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
